      // [NO SOPORTADO] Mecánica/secuencia condicional: requiere modelado manual.
      descriptionTemplate: "- Each stack of Crown of Wills additionally increases Augusta's Crit. DMG by 15%.  - The max stack of Crown of Wills is increased to 2. - Casting Intro Skill - Stride of Goldenflare now grants 1  of Crown of Wills.  - Resonance Skill - Undying Sunlight: Strike, Resonance Skill - Undying Sunlight: Leap, and Resonance Skill - Undying Sunlight: Plunge are now immune to interruption.",
